@startuml System Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Campus IoT Anomaly Detection - System Architecture

package "Client Layer" {
  [Flask Dashboard\n:5000] as Dashboard
  [External Client] as Client
}

package "API Services" {
  [Backend API\nFastAPI :8000] as BackendAPI
  [Model API\nFastAPI :8001] as ModelAPI
}

package "Data Storage" {
  database "SQLite Databases" {
    [campus_iot_data.db] as MainDB
    [websocket_data.db] as WebSocketDB
    [Custom DB\n(X-Database-Name)] as CustomDB
  }
}

package "Machine Learning" {
  [Random Forest Model\nrandom_forest_model.pkl] as Model
  [Model Metadata\nJSON] as Metadata
}

package "Data Sources" {
  [CSV Files] as CSV
  [WebSocket Data Stream] as WSStream
  [Feature Names\nJSON] as Features
}

' Connections
Dashboard --> BackendAPI : HTTP REST
Dashboard --> ModelAPI : HTTP REST
Client --> BackendAPI : HTTP REST
Client --> ModelAPI : HTTP REST\nWebSocket

BackendAPI --> MainDB : Read/Write
BackendAPI --> CustomDB : Read/Write\n(X-Database-Name)
ModelAPI --> BackendAPI : HTTP REST\nFetch Training/Testing Data
ModelAPI --> MainDB : Read (via Backend)
ModelAPI --> WebSocketDB : Write
ModelAPI --> Model : Load/Save
ModelAPI --> Metadata : Load/Save

CSV --> BackendAPI : POST /new
WSStream --> ModelAPI : WebSocket\n/ws/data-stream
Features --> ModelAPI : Load Feature Names

note right of BackendAPI
  Endpoints:
  - GET /api/health
  - POST /new
  - GET /api/view
  - GET /training
  - GET /testing
  - PUT /validate
  - POST /clear
  - POST /insert
end note

note right of ModelAPI
  Endpoints:
  - GET /health
  - POST /train
  - POST /test
  - POST /predict
  - GET /model/status
  - GET /model/metrics
  - WebSocket /ws/data-stream
end note

@enduml
